<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>客户端 on Apache HugeGraph</title><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/versions/1.0/cn/docs/quickstart/client/</link><description>Recent content in 客户端 on Apache HugeGraph</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/versions/1.0/cn/docs/quickstart/client/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>HugeGraph-Client Quick Start</title><link>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/versions/1.0/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hugegraph-oink.staged.apache.org/versions/1.0/cn/docs/quickstart/client/hugegraph-client/</guid><description>&lt;h3 id="1-hugegraph-client概述"&gt;1 HugeGraph-Client概述&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;HugeGraph-Client向HugeGraph-Server发出HTTP请求，获取并解析Server的执行结果。目前仅提供了Java版，用户可以使用HugeGraph-Client编写Java代码操作HugeGraph，比如元数据和图数据的增删改查，或者执行gremlin语句。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>